\nI'll leave the basic situation to Tamara.\n\nI have two requests for color illustrations\nA little sexy devilish boy\nThis is what I was thinking of.\nhttps://x.com/yamasodachi55/status/1862242376577949857\n\nI like cute boys, so I would be happy if the composition is such that you can see that.\n\nIf you can provide a transparent background and unintegrated PSD file of the character, please do.\nI will use it for my own wallpaper, icons, personal printing, etc.\nI plan to use the illustration on Twitter.\nI may use them as materials for requests to other people.\nI will always annotate the teacher before publishing.\nWe would very much appreciate your consideration!", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamasodachi55/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2510320, "client_id": 2905944, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/63c532c2/uploads/origins/24379755-a5e9-4e88-ad7b-22159e5e5308?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8cba96426678048ed466e7c04305adde", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/63c532c2/uploads/origins/24379755-a5e9-4e88-ad7b-22159e5e5308?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8cba96426678048ed466e7c04305adde, https://si.imgix.net/63c532c2/uploads/origins/24379755-a5e9-4e88-ad7b-22159e5e5308?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb446effbecb071739f660bcc598fa7d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/63c532c2/uploads/origins/24379755-a5e9-4e88-ad7b-22159e5e5308?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fbd980abfa9dd6d1cb38adf5b4c7f7b5 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/63c532c2/uploads/origins/24379755-a5e9-4e88-ad7b-22159e5e5308?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9906768a037bd449c5038188cd87480a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/63c532c2/uploads/origins/24379755-a5e9-4e88-ad7b-22159e5e5308?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9906768a037bd449c5038188cd87480a, https://si.imgix.net/63c532c2/uploads/origins/24379755-a5e9-4e88-ad7b-22159e5e5308?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=593b5b6a37ad4aef63cf31eeacf9f84b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/63c532c2/uploads/origins/24379755-a5e9-4e88-ad7b-22159e5e5308?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c5a056beaafc0a0322e8b5384b5ada69 3x"}, "body": "Hello, I saw your lovely illustration of my character in X!\nI saw Tamara㌠s very cute and wonderful illustrations on X and I really wanted to request you to draw my character as well!\nI especially love your illustration of Nugumaki-kun, and when I saw it, it touched my heart!\nThe details of the character I would like you to draw for me are as follows\n\nCharacter Information\nGender: Boy\nEyes: Red right eye and light blue left eye\nHair: Light blue\nOther decorations\nThree earrings on each earlobe\nLight blue and red hairpin on the left side of his hair\nA mole under her left eye\nLight pigmentation overall\nPersonality\nMocking, whimsical, friendly\n\nI love Tamara㌠s art style so much that I would like to leave everything to her, including the composition and facial expressions!\nI am also open to changes in hairstyles and outfits!\n\nI would like to use your illustration as a standby for my iPad, so I would like it to be a horizontal illustration of about 4:3!\n\nIf this request is difficult or you are not willing to do so, please do not hesitate to resend the amount or cancel the order!\nI know you are busy, but please consider this request 🤲.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-GTpLik2VrU1v65LGBxs-5DISi2IRdus", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": 