love Tamara's illustrations and I always enjoy looking at her wonderful pictures! I would like to commission an illustration from you!\nThis is my first time to request skeb, so I apologize if I don't have enough information.\n\nDetails of the request\nI would like to have two beautiful neutral boys dressed in jersey maid outfits. The clothes should be light blue, white, and black.\n\nI would like to use the picture I commissioned from Tamara as a keepsake.\n\nBoy (1)\nA beautiful boy with wolf hair, black hair, and blue eyes. He is more cool than cute. He should have about 3 piercings in his ears (either one or the other is fine, even if one eye is not hidden by his bangs!)\n\nBoy ②.\nNeutral, beautiful boy with mashed hair, grayish hair, and wavy eyelashes. I prefer light blue eyes. He is more cute than cool, sleepy and slow-paced.\n\nI would like the motif to be angelic, but with a slightly dark, light-hearted atmosphere.\nI would like to leave the pose and composition to Tamara! I would be happy if you could draw the image as you see fit!\n\nIf there are any difficulties with the request, please decline. I would appreciate your consideration.", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamasodachi55/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/424b35d4/uploads/origins/a8580e22-ee72-4125-919c-aebc46c98e11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=60be6e2c12c22ebdef93128d4281c83e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/424b35d4/uploads/origins/a8580e22-ee72-4125-919c-aebc46c98e11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=60be6e2c12c22ebdef93128d4281c83e, https://si.imgix.net/424b35d4/uploads/origins/a8580e22-ee72-4125-919c-aebc46c98e11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=74a7bf3a4f9c5464987de4d93021bef2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/424b35d4/uploads/origins/a8580e22-ee72-4125-919c-aebc46c98e11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ec759e9ff69c5189a8e2ac1224975b8a 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2510320, "nc": 128}, {"path": "/@yamasodachi55/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2510320, "client_id": 193145, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fead2963/uploads/origins/b849ff2a-f7a8-4826-9aba-6ae24e10da51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=991aa8d28bf3889dfa3e0237dfe09c66", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fead2963/uploads/origins/b849ff2a-f7a8-4826-9aba-6ae24e10da51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=991aa8d28bf3889dfa3e0237dfe09c66, https://si.imgix.net/fead2963/uploads/origins/b849ff2a-f7a8-4826-9aba-6ae24e10da51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13eba4e409f35f2b6f4e76370c6f83b5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fead2963/uploads/origins/b849ff2a-f7a8-4826-9aba-6ae24e10da51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c34f0943628cdfbde0d1199a2172c5a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fead2963/uploads/origins/b849ff2a-f7a8-4826-9aba-6ae24e10da51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4682325b39e8f39081933cb3a3038fea", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fead2963/uploads/origins/b849ff2a-f7a8-4826-9aba-6ae24e10da51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4682325b39e8f39081933cb3a3038fea, https://si.imgix.net/fead2963/uploads/origins/b849ff2a-f7a8-4826-9aba-6ae24e10da51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2ca7b27b5ea45d965af2b99a0d895c8c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fead2963/uploads/origins/b849ff2a-f7a8-4826-9aba-6ae24e10da51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=42ea5a6bd2380323cc262c9362c14142 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you. I admire your work! Please draw 2 characters who are from fantasy Japan.\n\nChara A. Calligrapher. From a noble family. Naive. Can be selfish. His eyes are always twinkling.\n\nChara B. Servant. Hard worker. Cautious. Unlucky. He always looks tired.\n\nThe two are childhood friends. Chara A depends a lot on Chara B.\n\nI will leave the rest to you. Thank you! \n\nReference 👇\n\nhttps://sta.sh/21pwcwzeznb3", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamasodachi55/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2510320, "client_id": 1531284, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d7a3f76/uploads/origins/24b6f7b1-8167-4a3b-9493-2ba3b256b382?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=236877e9a8056ad99a7cf7a02167aa4d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4d7a3f76/uploads/origins/24b6f7b1-8167-4a3b-9493-2ba3b256b382?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=236877e9a8056ad99a7cf7a02167aa4d, https://si.imgix.net/4d7a3f76/uploads/origins/24b6f7b1-8167-4a3b-9493-2ba3b256b382?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd984903759381aa7ddbf574a0c79714 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4d7a3f76/uploads/origins/24b6f7b1-8167-4a3b-9493-2ba3b256b382?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c51356d02efa7e44c289819576469824 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d7a3f76/uploads/origins/24b6f7b1-8167-4a3b-9493-2ba3b256b382?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f13fc7cdb32129d86a61adf28078b394", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4d7a3f76/uploads/origins/24b6f7b1-8167-4a3b-9493-2ba3b256b382?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f13fc7cdb32129d86a61adf28078b394, https://si.imgix.net/4d7a3f76/uploads/origins/24b6f7b1-8167-4a3b-9493-2ba3b256b382?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9e3cba4ea692e197218e75190f90d55b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4d7a3f76/uploads/origins/24b6f7b1-8167-4a3b-9493-2ba3b256b382?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=38ecde68734f9b235f70a52a7b4aeb7e 3x"}, "body": "Dear Tamara, it is nice to meet you! This is my first time to make a request. I enjoyed looking at your beautiful drawings! I am attracted by your beautiful drawings and would like to commission Tamara to illustrate my own character if it is possible.\n\n[Details of the request\nPlease see the following URL for references to the character and her attire. They are two senior and junior members of an elf tribe serving at a shrine in a Japanese-style fantasy setting. We have known each other for a long time, so we are very close now.\n\n[1]\nJunior (short-haired girl, 177cm). She has a kind and calm personality on the outside, but inside she is a bit tsundere and a bit cocky. She is a caring person. Her right eye is brown and her left eye is blue.\n\n2]\nSenpai (pony-tailed girl, 180cm). He is cool and quiet on the front and shy on the back. He is kind of a pain in the ass because he is always being taken care of by others. Please wear ear ornaments only on the left ear.\n\nIf possible, please draw a single illustration with the motif of \"hydrangea\" between the two of them. We would be very happy if you could draw them in a calm atmosphere. We would like to leave the other poses and composition to Tamara, so please feel free to draw them!\n\nIf there are any difficulties or problems with the request, please feel free to decline.\nThank you very much for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1zme8Lu3By7Ay44m-CSSQKymAQRRT0M-a?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 8389, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "茜屋＠SDイラスト仕事募集中", "screen_name": "akaneya", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1844116880795238402/XswYVp8C.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/19073510/1534469475/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 14, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 32}, {"id": 420976, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "AJANOKO", "screen_name": "AJANOKONOKO", "avatar_url": "https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/?d=identicon", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 16}, {"id": 1409907, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "🦈", "screen_name": "AShatiue", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1678018524885950467/dc2NSlJ5.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1214857203942752256/1652176004/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "pop